<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We must ever preach the gospel,</l><l>Thus our friends and neighbors gain;</l><l>House to house with vital partners,</l><l>That our new ones will remain.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We must ever preach the gospel,</l><l>Cherishing and nourishing;</l><l>Loving them as our dear children,</l><l>As our priestly offering.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We must ever preach the gospel</l><l>By perfecting in the homes</l><l>Through the word and prayer and singing,</l><l>Never laboring alone.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>We must ever preach the gospel,</l><l>Learning how to prophesy</l><l>For the building of the Body,</l><l>Thus the Lord to glorify.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
